### GDPR + admin surfaces. Set @host from the Aspire dashboard's "api" endpoint.
@host = https://localhost:7443
@subject = demo-user

### GDPR Article 20 — export the full data bundle
GET {{host}}/api/v1/me/export
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}

### GDPR Article 17 — erase the account (purges user-owned rows, tombstones the identity)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/me
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### Admin: connector/import registry status (requires the admin role → 403 for a plain user)
GET {{host}}/internal/import/status
X-Debug-Subject: admin-user
X-Debug-Role: admin

### Same call as a plain user → expect 403 Forbidden
GET {{host}}/internal/import/status
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Debug-Role: user
